{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eed64dd18bbdd25e55139d796de69f90e08f65fb6c0c1967b3b26d9d75b4599b", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の\n撮影だ。環、そろそろ着替え終わったかな……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真照杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》。\n环应该换好衣服了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "813458e884debfbc9932ea69ea14a0b67c61c9efa79d8f4dd35459de889f17a3", "ja": "おやぶん！　たまき、着替えてきた！\nでも、う～ん……。", "zh": "老大！环换好衣服了！\n可是……唔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "f0556e0c9a2d8a7c8c1f3264d6160bef9e6ae91afa7708bce990a8f291e5719f", "ja": "なんか、変な感じがする。\n制服って、動きづらいぞ……。", "zh": "感觉有点怪怪的。\n穿制服好难活动喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4dbdd64e8da092fa7971cc789fe7de971fa156bd7568556f97768c4d54678b0a", "ja": "そうか。\n普段、制服を着慣れてないせいかな……。", "zh": "这样啊，\n可能是你平常不习惯穿制服吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "741910498a8449d4c0e35104f4515a1962bbc2eb9c0bdf4d3e08e0ca025c1f30", "ja": "うん。でも中学生になったら、毎日制服を\n着ないといけないんだよね？　育とももこが言ってた！", "zh": "嗯，可是成为国中生之后，\n就得每天穿制服了吧？育跟桃子是这么说的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cb0ceae8723c33308ecea22f3485c937ddf6814e652464f45d3ca9d7421b4d8e", "ja": "そうだな。今のうちに慣れておいた方がいいかも\nしれないけど……無理せず、自然体でいこう。", "zh": "对啊，或许趁现在先习惯一下比较好……\n但还是别勉强，自然发挥吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "d9631f00020bfbfdf1f7c6056505f6a71c3b810b030c530d845087b28bef7f58", "ja": "わかった！　たまき、がんばる！\n……でもおやぶん、しぜんたいって何？", "zh": "知道了！环会加油的！\n……可是老大，「自然发挥」是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b462578d2c3714a6bc63d63188525b906cc38c0ad6109cbbc960b842c400d5c6", "ja": "ええと、そうだな……\nいつもの、元気な環って事だ。", "zh": "呃，就是……\n展现出环平常那种活力充沛的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "f942dd981433690b23c703d9502c20dfad416cad33f8a64d9b19b66b4599217e", "ja": "いつものたまきでいいの？　わかった。\nじゃあたまき、やってみるね！", "zh": "保持平常的环就可以了吗？\n好，那环试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "3390a14604bee0f2f1daf31a164acf40e814c281e6a47c2d74d97503eb958bf4", "ja": "しぜんたい、しぜんたい……こう？\nそれとも、こう？　こうかな……？", "zh": "自然发挥、自然发挥……这样吗？\n还是这样？或这样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1010_p", "source_sha256": "793f6862166b8fa56f57358af6c392ba6c6894f99a5d72a92878bbd8d286c85a", "ja": "（慣れない制服のせいか、環の動きが少し硬い。\n環らしい、快活さが出せるようにするには……）", "zh": "（大概是不习惯制服，环的动作有点僵硬。\n要怎么让环表现出她原本的活泼自在呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_1011", "source_sha256": "9c1891baee36a5f7d4c9386d602e76e268079606875e58e8f9c595bb580fd182", "ja": "変身だ！", "zh": "来变身吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_2000_p", "source_sha256": "669e0c563c4cba3a632884c69eb4c0f7e187c17a41a05b4833224a6ab27d12a6", "ja": "つまり制服は、アイドルの仕事のための変身……。\n今から、お仕事モードの環だ！", "zh": "简单来说，穿制服是为了偶像工作的变身……\n从现在开始，你就是工作模式的环了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_2001_040tam", "source_sha256": "aaba534e07a228e848a9d7f979c7baa8491a6e662aee9b34da069722174656ed", "ja": "お仕事モードのたまき……でもおやぶん、\nヒーローみたいに赤くないし、普通の色だけどいいの？", "zh": "工作模式的环……可是老大，制服是一般的颜色，\n又不像英雄一样是红的，没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_2002_p", "source_sha256": "38a4ddbff705f76fd4a2b23be39621ed3596198570585350a59b20e6ab4ad7c1", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\n環、どうだ？", "zh": "嗯，当然没关系。\n环，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_2003_040tam", "source_sha256": "2b930d538f4e11c3aa0f2d7ecd846cc32f89ea70ddb79286bb49ed79495b96c0", "ja": "わかった！\nたまきも……変身っ！", "zh": "好！\n环也要……变身！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_2004_040tam", "source_sha256": "1b07a9391542388a2a9a01f747b76279840dc518f457d1ff952fe763d0df1a91", "ja": "うん！　変身したから、お仕事モードのたまきだぞ！\nがんばるぞ～、くふふ♪", "zh": "嗯！变身过后就是工作模式的环啰！\n环要加油～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_2005_p", "source_sha256": "51c6369cecdec3149369619948efce484f1ca95fc4998c2aeda1871390a4f767", "ja": "（その後の撮影は、順調に進んだ。\nたまに、勇ましいポーズになったりもしたが……）", "zh": "（之后的拍摄进展得很顺利。\n虽然环不时会摆出英勇的姿势……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0113_2006_p", "source_sha256": "558f85773385ef4ab01f6ae928c730fef5c75eaaed2207df9a849da02b4cb11b", "ja": "（まあ、それも環らしさだな！）", "zh": "（也罢，这样才像环嘛！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
